# DataPulse daily batch (installed on the Groot home server).
# Groot's system clock is UTC, so 21:00 here = 17:00 Toronto (EDT).
# The job itself computes "today" in America/Toronto (ingestion/run_once.py),
# so the logical date is the Toronto calendar day regardless of server TZ.
# Each run loads the same calendar day from 2023 (ingestion/logical_date.py).
#
# Install:  (crontab -l; cat deploy/crontab) | crontab -
# Paths below assume the repo is at /home/groot/projects/DataPulse-Pipeline-Monitor.
0 21 * * * /home/groot/projects/DataPulse-Pipeline-Monitor/scripts/run_daily.sh
